<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3" title="In A.2 Aggregation of multiple answers from LLMs ‣ Appendix A Related work ‣ Best-of-∞ – Asymptotic Performance of Test-Time Compute" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">(3) Cascading</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS2.SSS0.Px4" title="In A.2 Aggregation of multiple answers from LLMs ‣ Appendix A Related work ‣ Best-of-∞ – Asymptotic Performance of Test-Time Compute" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Answer selection based on reward models and LLM-as-a-judge</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Best-of-∞ – Asymptotic Performance of Test-Time Compute" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Best-of-∞ – Asymptotic Performance of Test-Time Compute" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>List of LLMs and Problem sets</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Best-of-∞ – Asymptotic Performance of Test-Time Compute" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Bo1 and Best-of-<math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\infty</annotation></semantics></math> performance of each model</span></a>
