<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS2" title="In Appendix D Bo1 and Best-of-∞ performance of each model ‣ Best-of-∞ – Asymptotic Performance of Test-Time Compute" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2 </span>Prompts for LLM-as-a-judge</span></a></li>
