<td id="S4.T1.3.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">98.59<span id="footnote6" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">6</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">6</sup>
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">6</span>
                      
                      
                      
                    We do not use chain-of-thought (CoT) in our experiments and thus the file size is small; however, we also include an updated dataset that contains CoT.</span></span></span></td></tr>
